  "comments": [
    {"address": "0x480980", "comment": "[RE-SAN9PK-0119] Each xun with a positive alliance duration after scenario start subtracts one turn; reaching zero emits expiry case 3, which clears alliance state."},
    {"address": "0x57B3F0", "comment": "[RE-SAN9PK-0119] Quarterly formation gate: no active alliance, normal scenario mode, 1-in-4 global roll, at least 360 elapsed days, and an eligible target with at least three eligible members."},
