    {"address": "0x57C050", "comment": "[RE-SAN9PK-0119] On accepted formation, initializes 36 xun, marks target bit 6, leader bit 5, participants bit 4, raises leader base prestige by 25, adjusts relations, and cancels conflicting internal orders."},
